--- !u!114 &757171599
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 757171597}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 31f2577016634764bade2bf0d5d44b6b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  meterController: {fileID: 1363181443}
  diagBox: {fileID: 706798297}
  diagChar: {fileID: 582356082}
  diagText: {fileID: 912673195}
  nextButton: {fileID: 983477790}
  choicePanel: {fileID: 2020752930}
  choiceButtonPrefab: {fileID: 1680844180}
  typingAudioSource: {fileID: 339312251}
  defaultTypingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b31c2664721883349afef1befb712376, type: 3}
  events:
  - characterName: ' '
    dialogueText: 'The bar is a pool of warm light in a dark, narrow alley. Inside,
      the air is thick with old money and expensive perfume. Polished wood gleams.
      Ice clinks.

'
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 0}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Rutil
    dialogueText: ("Lumen Alley." The text message promised a "hefty amount" just
      to show up. My agency isn't going to fund itself, and "nothing better to do"
      is my default state. Still... this place is high-end. The clients are usually
      as polished as the silverware, and just as cold.)
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 1350676010}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: ' '
    dialogueText: 'Rutil, entering the bar sees a bartender finishes polishing a
      glass with tense, jerky movements. Seated were three people with each of their
      own demeanor. One of the people seated looks like someone he has seen before
      he thought as while approaching the familiar figure.

'
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 0}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Rutil
    dialogueText: Excuse me. My name is Rutil. I was called here for... an investigation.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 1350676010}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Elena
    dialogueText: A pleasure. I am Elena. I was...
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 961838713}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Rutil
    dialogueText: "Elena... the Elena? I... I never thought I\u2019d meet you. I\u2019ve
      heard so much about your detective work."
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 1350676010}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices:
    - choiceText: What brings you here, of all places?
      jumpIndex: -1
      meterAdjustment: 0
    - choiceText: It's an absolute honor.
      jumpIndex: -1
      meterAdjustment: 0
  - characterName: Elena
    dialogueText: "It\u2019s a pleasure, young man. But I'm afraid this isn't a social
      call. I was brought here for an investigation. The same goes for the flashy
      fellow in the corner. I'm assuming it's the case for you, too?\r\n"
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 961838713}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Rutil
    dialogueText: It is. But... why would they bring three people for this case?
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 1350676010}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Elena
    dialogueText: (Sighs softly) I'm afraid this isn't a standard case, Mr. Rutil.
      This is all set up.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 961838713}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Rutil
    dialogueText: A set up? For what?
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 1350676010}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Elena
    dialogueText: (Nodding toward the corner) That flashy looking man is Cassian.
      He's more of a media personality than a detective. The bartender is Leigh,
      our suspect. The young woman in the booth is Maddison, our "victim." From what
      I gather, we've all been cast in an episode of some dreadful reality TV show.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 961838713}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Rutil
    dialogueText: (A TV show... The cryptic call. The "hefty amount." It's not a
      retainer, it's prize money?)
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 1350676010}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices:
    - choiceText: You're telling me this is all staged?
      jumpIndex: 12
      meterAdjustment: 0
    - choiceText: So what's the 'case' we're supposed to be solving?
      jumpIndex: 13
      meterAdjustment: 0
  - characterName: Elena
    dialogueText: The tv crew aren't here yet, but they will be. The situations seem
      real enough, but they are planning to build around it for entertainment
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 961838713}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: 16
    choices: []
  - characterName: Elena
    dialogueText: The premise seems to be that the patron's drink was poisoned, and
      the bartender, is the only one who prepared it, making her the prime suspect.
      It falls to the three of us to "uncover" the truth.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 961838713}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: 16
    choices: []
  - characterName: ' '
    dialogueText: Suddenly, the heavy front door swings open.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 0}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: ' '
    dialogueText: A tall woman in a stunning red dress enters, a wide-brimmed hat
      casting a dramatic shadow over her face. A microphone gleams in her hand. Behind
      her, a camera operator and a sound technician flood the room with harsh, bright
      light.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 0}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: ' '
    dialogueText: The atmosphere shatters. Leigh freezes. Maddison flinches. Cassian,
      however, grins with excitement.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 0}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Cassian
    dialogueText: Finally! Took you awhile.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 188772289}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Elena
    dialogueText: My my... I haven't been on television for a long time. Good luck,
      young man.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 961838713}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: ' '
    dialogueText: The woman in red steps into the center of the room, her voice booming.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 0}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Valentina
    dialogueText: Welcome, welcome, to "Crime Time LIVE"! I am your host, Valentina!
      Tonight, a shocking crime in an exclusive location. A wealthy heiress... a
      trusted bartender... and a drink laced with poison!
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 568991861}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Valentina
    dialogueText: Welcome, welcome, to "Crime Time LIVE"! I am your host, Valentina!
      Tonight, a shocking crime in an exclusive location. A wealthy heiress... a
      trusted bartender... and a drink laced with poison!
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 568991861}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Valentina
    dialogueText: The lovely Maddison, our victim! The terrified Leigh, our suspect!
      And... our three competing detectives!
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 568991861}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Valentina
    dialogueText: The lovely Maddison, our victim! The terrified Leigh, our suspect!
      And... our three detectives for this first round!
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 568991861}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Valentina
    dialogueText: The rules are simple! Our detectives will have one hour to investigate
      the place. Then, we begin the trial, right here! The detectives will be working
      together and deending on their contribution, it will affect their ranking placement
      for the upcoming rounds.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 568991861}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - characterName: Valentina
    dialogueText: 'Now... let the investigation... begin! '
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 0}
    activeChar: {fileID: 568991861}
    delay: 0
    jumpIndex: -1
    choices: []
  scrollSpeed: 0.05
  dialogueLog: {fileID: 807877375}
  spotlightControl: {fileID: 1363181443}
  running: 0
